WEBVTT

00:10:26.497 --> 00:10:30.334
and students are discovering
their own genius.

00:10:31.293 --> 00:10:32.544
Plus, I have to say,

00:10:32.544 --> 00:10:35.381
it's just a lot of fun to learn this way.

00:10:35.422 --> 00:10:36.590
(Laughter)

00:10:38.300 --> 00:10:41.887
Students who attend
our partner schools ...

00:10:44.473 --> 00:10:49.728
learn this way in every single stage
of their academic career.

00:10:51.480 --> 00:10:53.691
Starting in kindergarten,

00:10:53.732 --> 00:10:57.528
students are encouraged
to share their views,

00:10:57.528 --> 00:11:01.490
to ask questions and support each other.